<!--
  Time converter (plus/timeconv, research/173). Control and string names are used by timeconvfloater.cpp.
  Each row panel (row0 SL, row1 UTC, row2 and row3 a place of choice) has the same children:
  y, mo, d, h, mi (the fields), u_* (the unit marks), label or zone, info and copy.
  Generated once by a script; edit by hand from here on (the ja file has the same names).
-->
